            "title": "💥 Breaking Change",
            "collapsed": false,
            "entries": [
              "#### Track the monochange 0.21.0 CLI release\n\n_Owner:_ [@ifiokjr](https://github.com/ifiokjr) · _Review:_ [PR #102](https://github.com/monochange/actions/pull/102)\n\nThe actions development and release tooling now resolves monochange 0.21.0, including Swift, CocoaPods and Gradle configuration support. This follows the breaking CLI release baseline. After the next maintainer-controlled actions release, pin its immutable commit SHA to adopt that CLI baseline; the existing action inputs remain supported."
            ]
